# Pyroblast, first mode: "Counter target spell if it's blue." On turn 2 Bot2 casts a green Llanowar Elves and Bot1 aims a Pyroblast
# at it: the Elves resolve (the spell is not blue, so it is not countered). Bot2 then casts Third Path Iconoclast, a blue and red
# card, and the second Pyroblast counters it: a multicolored spell is blue if one of its colors is blue.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Pyroblast
Pyroblast
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Llanowar Elves
Third Path Iconoclast
Island x15

